      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Fellow neighbors, your participation is not a casual preference; it is a solemn contract with our community. To stay home because you dislike the options is to surrender your power to inertia and apathy. Every ballot cast, even to reject a dreadful choice, is a fundamental act of moral assertion against the status quo. Do not gamble your district's future by prioritizing comfort over your sacred duty to show up and demand better.",
